# CODEOWNERS — governance-file review gate.
#
# Every path below requires approval from @josh-iterabloom (the human maintainer).
# The agent account (jgstern-agent) must NOT self-approve or self-merge PRs that
# touch these files (AGENTS.md §Governance Files). This file documents that
# authoritative list; the gate is BEHAVIORAL, not forge-enforced. Branch
# protection deliberately does NOT enable "require review from Code Owners" —
# that setting forces a review on every PR, which would defeat auto-pr's
# green-CI auto-merge (decision: maintainer, 2026-08-10). Approval for
# governance PRs is a maintainer go-ahead on the PR thread (or in-session
# during pre-remote bootstrap), not a formal GitHub review.
#
# SYNTAX: GitHub reads this as gitignore-style globs (leading "/" anchors to the
# repo root; a trailing "/" matches a directory and everything under it).

# --- Agent-policy & governance config --------------------------------------
/AGENTS.md                     @josh-iterabloom
/ALLOWED_WEBSITES.md           @josh-iterabloom
/CODEOWNERS                    @josh-iterabloom

